1
00:00:00,294 --> 00:00:04,509
It's over. He wants to break up with me.
- His mother cried after we had the meeting.

2
00:00:04,509 --> 00:00:08,710
You showed me off and looked down on Jung Hoon.
You hurt his mom's pride.

3
00:00:09,225 --> 00:00:11,402
Mom, you must be happy that it turned out the way you wanted.

4
00:00:11,402 --> 00:00:13,638
I don't care if you're going to set me blind dates or not.

5
00:00:13,638 --> 00:00:15,889
Just leave me alone right now.

6
00:00:16,497 --> 00:00:18,945
I asked you why you aren't saying anything.

7
00:00:21,955 --> 00:00:24,230
Why are you acting like this? What's wrong?

8
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,922
- We broke up.
- You broke up with Hye Yoon?

9
00:00:26,922 --> 00:00:29,323
I like you, noonim.

10
00:00:29,898 --> 00:00:32,411
You shouldn't have touched my wife.

11
00:00:32,411 --> 00:00:35,966
- Oppa.
- Don't cry. I'm a player.

12
00:00:35,966 --> 00:00:38,096
Trash.

13
00:00:39,244 --> 00:00:41,321
My fahter is done reviewing our marriage.

14
00:00:41,321 --> 00:00:42,441
My family is done reviewing as well.

15
00:00:42,441 --> 00:00:45,010
- When should we meet each other's parents?
- Let's do it next week.

16
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:47,009
Let's move quickly if we have decided.

17
00:00:49,614 --> 00:00:51,632
It's been a long time.

18
00:01:02,103 --> 00:01:04,003
Are you crazy?

19
00:01:04,285 --> 00:01:07,882
Hye Yoon just came and went. Weren't you two supposed to meet up?

20
00:01:07,882 --> 00:01:13,844
She was a little weird. She is different from normal. She has her mind elsewhere. She almost got hit by my bike!

21
00:01:13,844 --> 00:01:18,938
And she was talking about a weird poem and habits or something.

22
00:01:20,073 --> 00:01:23,722
Episode 4 : Defend a wedding hall

23
00:01:40,905 --> 00:01:43,436
I hope you were flustered because I asked to meet with you.

24
00:01:43,436 --> 00:01:46,325
No, I wanted to meet you too.

25
00:01:46,325 --> 00:01:49,581
Just like we said, i set the date.

26
00:01:49,581 --> 00:01:53,431
While I was finding the date, I found out their marital compatibility is very good.

27
00:01:53,431 --> 00:01:55,758
- But the kids~
- - In-law.

28
00:01:55,758 --> 00:02:01,700
They fight while preparing their wedding.
We must help them get back together.

29
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:04,258
But we can't force them to be together.

30
00:02:04,258 --> 00:02:10,010
That's right, but in this situation no matter who looks at it, they didn't break up because they lost affection.

31
00:02:10,010 --> 00:02:12,494
You think it is because of me?

32
00:02:12,494 --> 00:02:15,420
No, how could it be because of you?

33
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:17,539
- It's because of me.
- No...

34
00:02:17,539 --> 00:02:20,796
- I'm sorry.
- No, Hye Yoon's mother.

35
00:02:20,796 --> 00:02:24,141
I was very emotional that day.

36
00:02:25,029 --> 00:02:27,254
Jung Hoon is an amazing man.

37
00:02:27,254 --> 00:02:30,284
Thank you for raising him well and giving him to Hye Yoon.

38
00:02:30,284 --> 00:02:33,472
I feel ashamed if you come out like this.

39
00:02:33,472 --> 00:02:36,234
In-law, i wish to get along.

40
00:02:36,234 --> 00:02:39,534
I wish that too. But it depends on Jung Hoon.

41
00:02:39,534 --> 00:02:42,525
The only reason why I accepted this marriage

42
00:02:42,525 --> 00:02:45,101
was because my son wanted Hye Yoon.

43
00:02:45,101 --> 00:02:49,534
But now that has become unclear so I don't know what to do.

44
00:02:49,968 --> 00:02:51,979
Should i broke off this engagement?

45
00:02:51,979 --> 00:02:55,960
But my heart hurts to hear that Hye Yoon's heart hurts.

46
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:58,792
I'll at least try talking to Jung Hoon.

47
00:03:07,414 --> 00:03:09,562
- Where are you going?
- It's stuffy.

48
00:03:09,562 --> 00:03:10,854
Don't do this marriage.

49
00:03:10,854 --> 00:03:13,222
Even if you tell me to do it, I won't be able to. Don't worry.

50
00:03:13,222 --> 00:03:16,974
I met Jung Hoon's mom. She's so insecure.

51
00:03:16,974 --> 00:03:20,482
Why you met her? She was upset at you because of the meeting.

52
00:03:20,482 --> 00:03:22,368
So I met her to resolve it.

53
00:03:22,368 --> 00:03:25,083
Resolve what? You probably set it on fire.

54
00:03:25,422 --> 00:03:27,740
Mom, you don't want for me to be happy, do you?

55
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:30,864
I devoted my life for the happiness of you and your sister.
What are you talking about?

56
00:03:30,864 --> 00:03:34,395
You always say that. Do you know how hard it was for me and my sister because of you?

57
00:03:34,395 --> 00:03:37,311
You are the one that got dumped my a man because you cannot control him.

58
00:03:37,311 --> 00:03:39,395
Is it my fault for being dumped? It's your fault.

59
00:03:39,395 --> 00:03:42,965
You were so rude talking about poop and other stuff at the meeting.

60
00:03:42,965 --> 00:03:44,969
In the end you are on Jung Hoon's mother's side.

61
00:03:44,969 --> 00:03:47,858
I can't believe i apologized to her for you, even if it hurt my pride.

62
00:03:47,858 --> 00:03:50,629
- You sure would have begged.
- I ought to!

63
00:03:50,629 --> 00:03:52,437
You are going to use violence since words don't work!

64
00:03:52,437 --> 00:03:55,730
If you think that i'm a bad mother, then get out of this house.

65
00:03:55,730 --> 00:03:59,185
Actually i was thinking that.
You think i can't do it?

66
00:04:00,504 --> 00:04:02,472
Where are you going?

67
00:04:04,132 --> 00:04:05,132
What's wrong with her?

68
00:04:05,132 --> 00:04:07,351
She is acting like that because I went to meet Jung Hoon's mother.

69
00:04:07,793 --> 00:04:09,769
Did something bad happen when you met her?

70
00:04:09,769 --> 00:04:12,086
She isn't a normal woman.

71
00:04:12,086 --> 00:04:15,908
I tried my best, but Hye Yoon is mad at me, because i met her.

72
00:04:16,571 --> 00:04:19,330
Therefore you must change your image towards your daughters.

73
00:04:19,330 --> 00:04:22,419
I don't need them. They have no idea how much i've done for them.

74
00:04:22,419 --> 00:04:25,869
The one thinks that i'm cold hearted, without blood running to my vains.

75
00:04:25,869 --> 00:04:27,763
And the other one doesn't even come to see me.

76
00:04:27,763 --> 00:04:29,796
Hae Jin doesn't even answer your calls, after the meeting.

77
00:04:30,468 --> 00:04:33,642
I think, this is not good at all.

78
00:04:33,642 --> 00:04:36,813
I don't care if they don't answer my calls. Let's see if they can live happily.

79
00:04:49,518 --> 00:04:51,975
Mom.

80
00:05:21,503 --> 00:05:24,741
I knew you would do this. Why don't you answer my calls when you are home?

81
00:05:24,741 --> 00:05:27,283
Why couldn't I contact you since that day? Is your husband having an affair?

82
00:05:27,283 --> 00:05:29,567
Ask one thing at a time. Should I get you something to drink?

83
00:05:29,567 --> 00:05:33,027
- What do you have?
- There is plum tea. I can make it into ice tea.

84
00:05:34,546 --> 00:05:37,058
What did your husband do?

85
00:05:37,895 --> 00:05:39,896
Talk to me.

86
00:05:39,896 --> 00:05:43,836
I have only two daughters and they make me worry a lot.

87
00:05:43,836 --> 00:05:46,668
Hye Yoon doesn't make you worry. It's just me that is causing problems.

88
00:05:47,923 --> 00:05:50,073
Who told you that you are causing problems?

89
00:05:50,073 --> 00:05:51,931
Who is the one who takes on the role as big sister?

90
00:05:53,015 --> 00:05:55,086
There is nothing serious between me and my husband.

91
00:05:55,577 --> 00:05:57,615
- Give me your cell phone.
- Why?

92
00:05:57,615 --> 00:05:59,435
I told you to give me it.

93
00:06:10,349 --> 00:06:13,278
This bastard!

94
00:06:13,897 --> 00:06:18,162
I knew he would do this. I wondered what it was when I saw your expression that day.

95
00:06:19,219 --> 00:06:21,159
You were overwhelmed when you saw this.

96
00:06:21,159 --> 00:06:23,568
You really are persistent!

97
00:06:23,568 --> 00:06:25,379
They say son in laws are bastards.

98
00:06:25,379 --> 00:06:27,072
Tell this bastard to come here right now!

99
00:06:27,072 --> 00:06:28,876
- It's useless.
- Why is it useless?

100
00:06:28,876 --> 00:06:32,130
You must take the control of his money and this apartment now.

101
00:06:32,130 --> 00:06:34,821
- I don't need anything.
- Why do you not need it? Idiot!

102
00:06:34,821 --> 00:06:37,733
I told you constantly that you have to prepare for things like this.

103
00:06:37,733 --> 00:06:39,928
It's not the first time his doing that.

104
00:06:40,456 --> 00:06:43,177
Where is the phone? I should call.

105
00:06:43,177 --> 00:06:44,905
Don't do this.

106
00:06:44,905 --> 00:06:47,800
I don't want to live.

107
00:06:48,789 --> 00:06:52,763
I don't want to live.

108
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:56,330
I don't want...

109
00:07:00,052 --> 00:07:04,310
Don't delete the photo that the girl sent you.

110
00:07:09,985 --> 00:07:12,806
I think it's too natural. I think more should have been inserted.

111
00:07:12,806 --> 00:07:14,286
I think it will come out quickly.

112
00:07:14,286 --> 00:07:18,528
I put it just fine, so it will not come out easily.

113
00:07:18,528 --> 00:07:20,160
They do tell me I became pretty.

114
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:22,287
It will looks better the next week.

115
00:07:22,287 --> 00:07:26,003
Thank you, director. You really do have god's hands.

116
00:07:31,466 --> 00:07:32,803
What brings you here?

117
00:07:32,803 --> 00:07:36,083
I warned you before that if you hurt my child, I won't stay still!

118
00:07:46,075 --> 00:07:47,416
What's wrong?

119
00:07:47,416 --> 00:07:52,237
Get back to work. Tell the patients to come back later and give them coupons.

120
00:07:52,237 --> 00:07:54,167
Alright.

121
00:07:58,469 --> 00:08:00,883
If you are done breaking things, lets have a convertation.

122
00:08:00,883 --> 00:08:04,232
Conversation? That sounds good. Sit.

123
00:08:07,779 --> 00:08:09,616
What are you going to do?

124
00:08:09,616 --> 00:08:11,456
She wants divorce.

125
00:08:11,456 --> 00:08:14,678
So you are going to divorce her? I knew you would do this.

126
00:08:14,678 --> 00:08:17,115
People who abandoned their family once, they can do it again.

127
00:08:17,115 --> 00:08:18,652
Is divorce that easy to you?

128
00:08:18,652 --> 00:08:22,383
I need to get divorce with her, so i don't have to see you again.

129
00:08:22,383 --> 00:08:27,305
How much are you going to give her, for compensation?

130
00:08:27,305 --> 00:08:28,436
I will talk about it with my wife.

131
00:08:28,436 --> 00:08:30,861
When you lived with her, you didn't treat her like a human.

132
00:08:30,861 --> 00:08:33,409
Now that you getting divorce,you treating her like a human?

133
00:08:33,409 --> 00:08:35,294
Do you have anything more to say?

134
00:08:35,294 --> 00:08:39,017
I don't have anything to say right now. I think I will have things to say in the future about how you act.

135
00:08:46,146 --> 00:08:49,239
I'm not going to be able to see dad before going to sleep again.

136
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:54,459
You must like dad a lot even though he scolds you.

137
00:08:54,554 --> 00:08:58,269
When I am being scolded, I don't like it and then I forget about it quickly.

138
00:08:58,783 --> 00:09:02,602
You are like that too, right? You get scolded by dad a lot.

139
00:09:03,652 --> 00:09:10,090
Don't speak from now on. Since you are talking, you can't sleep when you have to.

140
00:09:11,568 --> 00:09:13,582
Close your eyes.

141
00:09:51,756 --> 00:09:53,067
Why are you being like this?

142
00:09:53,067 --> 00:09:57,200
Hey, do you think you were the only one suffering? Do you know how much stress I went through?

143
00:10:03,681 --> 00:10:07,289
Do you think a man has an affair for no reason? It's because he isn't satisfied when he is home.

144
00:10:07,289 --> 00:10:11,216
I was ready to let it go, but now i can't because of your cheap mother.

145
00:10:12,197 --> 00:10:14,091
Do you have the right to talk bad about my mom?

146
00:10:14,091 --> 00:10:15,943
What my mom done wrong?

147
00:10:15,943 --> 00:10:18,448
She did what supposed to do as my mom!
Is that wrong?

148
00:10:18,448 --> 00:10:21,027
Actually i wasn't going to get a divorce.

149
00:10:21,027 --> 00:10:24,298
But after i saw what she did to my hospital, i think i should get divorce.

150
00:10:24,298 --> 00:10:27,433
If you want to become happy, you need to throw away your mom.

151
00:10:28,936 --> 00:10:33,953
Right, you are her daughter.
I get it now.

152
00:10:35,183 --> 00:10:39,410
I will give you 100.000.000 won for compensation, but i will take care my son.

153
00:10:39,410 --> 00:10:43,943
How are you going to raise him?
I can't let your girlfriend take care of him.

154
00:10:43,943 --> 00:10:46,046
Don't worry. I will hire a care mother for him.

155
00:10:46,758 --> 00:10:51,618
Let's hurry and finished this. I don't want for us to get worse.

156
00:11:06,376 --> 00:11:11,328
Your mind is collapsing. Yes, it would be weird if your mind wasn't collapsing.

157
00:11:11,328 --> 00:11:13,598
Do you think he really did love me?

158
00:11:13,598 --> 00:11:16,277
You have reached the state of denying the past.

159
00:11:16,277 --> 00:11:19,102
Our love has now become the past.

160
00:11:19,102 --> 00:11:22,107
- Do you want me to call Jung Hoon for you?
- You want to die?

161
00:11:22,107 --> 00:11:25,071
Sang Jin oppa was concerned about you after you left like that.

162
00:11:25,071 --> 00:11:26,404
I'm not interested.

163
00:11:26,404 --> 00:11:27,783
He said he broke off the engagement.

164
00:11:27,783 --> 00:11:30,602
During the preparation for the marriage, he said there were a lot of problems with the woman.

165
00:11:30,602 --> 00:11:34,765
I think there are a lot of couples that break up while preparing for the marriage. Same goes for you two.

166
00:11:40,430 --> 00:11:44,281
Hey, what did I do?

167
00:11:45,669 --> 00:11:48,028
I'm just talking about what happens nowadays.

168
00:11:48,028 --> 00:11:51,903
Instead of divorcing after the marriage, it's better to break it off while preparing for the marriage.

169
00:11:52,328 --> 00:11:56,032
So our break up became a statistic now.

170
00:11:56,032 --> 00:12:00,324
I wasn't talking about you two.
I was talking about other couples.

171
00:12:00,324 --> 00:12:03,712
I'm going to go home. It doesn't feel comfortable here either.

172
00:12:03,712 --> 00:12:06,763
Hey, don't be like this.

173
00:12:06,763 --> 00:12:10,124
No, I am going to forget that narrow minded fool and live my life happily.

174
00:12:10,124 --> 00:12:13,064
Bastard, how could he not call me even once?

175
00:12:13,064 --> 00:12:17,816
Hey, it's only been a week since you guys broke up.

176
00:12:19,101 --> 00:12:20,828
It's only been a week?

177
00:12:20,828 --> 00:12:25,436
It's only been a week, but it feels like ten years that I suffered because of you.

178
00:12:35,274 --> 00:12:39,174
It has been only one week since we broke up.

179
00:12:40,019 --> 00:12:44,785
It feels like it's been a thousand years even though it's only been a week.

180
00:12:45,448 --> 00:12:49,653
No way... I can't endure it for 1000 ye...

181
00:13:06,931 --> 00:13:08,536
There was an accident. Wooil Hospital. Emergency room.

182
00:13:22,556 --> 00:13:24,596
Do you know where the car accident patients are?

183
00:13:24,596 --> 00:13:27,880
There are several car accident patients. What is there their name?

184
00:13:48,148 --> 00:13:50,872
What happened? You said you got into an accident. I couldn't find your name.

185
00:13:50,872 --> 00:13:52,763
It's because I came out without much measures.

186
00:13:52,763 --> 00:13:56,032
Are you hurt anywhere? Car accidents have an aftereffect. Just because it doesn't hurt now doesn't mean you should leave.

187
00:13:59,830 --> 00:14:01,287
Did you get hurt there?

188
00:14:01,287 --> 00:14:03,583
No. The heart inside.

189
00:14:04,959 --> 00:14:07,738
It was your heart? Not your body?

190
00:14:11,426 --> 00:14:15,509
I was scared! How could you joke around like this?

191
00:14:36,832 --> 00:14:38,998
I crossed when it was the red light.

192
00:14:39,463 --> 00:14:42,143
I think there is something wrong with my mind.

193
00:14:43,190 --> 00:14:46,237
It's only been a week since we broke up.

194
00:14:46,237 --> 00:14:49,699
It feels like it's been a thousand years. How could it have only been a week?

195
00:14:50,674 --> 00:14:54,114
- You don't love me.
- You are the one that doesn't love me.

196
00:14:54,114 --> 00:14:55,959
How do you only receive and not give?

197
00:14:57,629 --> 00:15:01,821
I grew up in a poor family, with the absence of my father.

198
00:15:02,796 --> 00:15:05,627
I can get away from being poor with my own strength.

199
00:15:06,244 --> 00:15:07,970
But, I can't get away from the fact I don't have a dad.

200
00:15:08,868 --> 00:15:11,775
I was constantly looking for a father like man.

201
00:15:11,775 --> 00:15:14,837
To me, you are a father like person.

202
00:15:15,061 --> 00:15:20,368
I realize now that a father doesn't indulge everything.

203
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:23,840
I'll do well.

204
00:15:29,372 --> 00:15:34,276
Do you know how scared I was? On my way here, I prayed to god again and again

205
00:15:34,276 --> 00:15:36,784
for nothing bad to have happened to you.

206
00:15:36,784 --> 00:15:40,163
I like you better than my mom. I can depend on you.

207
00:15:41,094 --> 00:15:43,914
I'm scared that I was going to be thrown away because I like you too much.

208
00:15:44,763 --> 00:15:47,161
I keep testing your love.

209
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:59,679
Who says that women have a higher level of maturity than men?

210
00:15:59,679 --> 00:16:02,685
You are such a child.

211
00:16:02,685 --> 00:16:05,655
Let's get married quickly.

212
00:16:33,995 --> 00:16:36,125
Demand suit for divorce.

213
00:16:50,472 --> 00:16:53,066
- I love you.
- Me too.

214
00:16:53,066 --> 00:16:55,399
Don't say 'me too' and say 'I love you'.

215
00:16:55,746 --> 00:16:58,176
I love you.

216
00:17:03,310 --> 00:17:05,988
If you want to stop, say it now.

217
00:17:05,988 --> 00:17:09,767
From now on, trust me and follow me.

218
00:17:09,767 --> 00:17:12,008
What if you get tired like this time?

219
00:17:12,224 --> 00:17:15,215
I said you must!

220
00:17:16,044 --> 00:17:18,380
I'll trust you.

221
00:17:24,347 --> 00:17:26,488
They must be in a hurry.

222
00:17:29,732 --> 00:17:31,236
Look at this.

223
00:17:34,827 --> 00:17:37,380
How did these people know we were getting married?

224
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:42,989
They know because I signed up to be a member. We need to move fast if we are going to get married.

225
00:17:42,989 --> 00:17:45,185
What are you going to say to your parents?

226
00:17:45,185 --> 00:17:47,663
I told you to trust me.

227
00:17:47,663 --> 00:17:50,020
It's embarrassing.

228
00:17:50,837 --> 00:17:54,347
I'll promise that something like this will never happen again.

229
00:17:55,877 --> 00:17:59,529
Then let's go for our wedding!

230
00:17:59,529 --> 00:18:01,183
Let's go!

231
00:18:16,371 --> 00:18:18,970
- Where could it possibly be?
- What are you looking for?

232
00:18:18,970 --> 00:18:20,424
Where is a dried squid?

233
00:18:28,564 --> 00:18:30,485
You should put things like this where it can be easily found.

234
00:18:31,124 --> 00:18:34,047
Think about what you did by yourself in the house.

235
00:18:36,375 --> 00:18:38,342
Sit down.

236
00:18:45,323 --> 00:18:49,049
I didn't stamp it. There was something we would have to agree upon before stamping.

237
00:18:49,469 --> 00:18:50,847
What is it?

238
00:18:50,847 --> 00:18:54,774
First, compensation. Second, division
of property. Third, custody.

239
00:18:54,774 --> 00:18:57,148
I will take 100,000,000
won for compensation.

240
00:18:57,148 --> 00:19:00,017
- Because you cheated on me.
- What the heck?

241
00:19:00,172 --> 00:19:02,327
Are you saying you're
taking that money for me?

242
00:19:02,327 --> 00:19:05,031
Give this house to me. Take your hospital.

243
00:19:05,031 --> 00:19:10,179
But give me half of the land and five
studio and resorts you bought in cash.

244
00:19:10,179 --> 00:19:12,490
Give me 500 won for custody.
We both have parental right.

245
00:19:12,490 --> 00:19:14,248
This is what I ask.

246
00:19:14,248 --> 00:19:17,777
- This is highway robbery.
- I've lived with you for seven years.

247
00:19:17,777 --> 00:19:19,442
I have a right to be like this.

248
00:19:19,891 --> 00:19:22,364
The actual maximum compensation
you can get is 5,000 won.

249
00:19:22,364 --> 00:19:24,859
By law, you can't have that amount of money.

250
00:19:24,859 --> 00:19:27,229
I'm being considerate now.
Just take that.

251
00:19:27,229 --> 00:19:30,306
After you married me, your property
was increased by 300 percent.

252
00:19:30,306 --> 00:19:32,636
I contributed to that.

253
00:19:32,636 --> 00:19:34,192
Even by law, I have a chance of winning.

254
00:19:34,192 --> 00:19:37,125
Maybe this is why people who are similar get married.

255
00:19:37,125 --> 00:19:38,553
Young Mi wasn't like this.

256
00:19:38,553 --> 00:19:40,766
You don't need to talk about your former wife.

257
00:19:40,766 --> 00:19:43,695
I know you have a secret
fund but I won't touch that.

258
00:19:44,486 --> 00:19:46,642
If I have to give you that
much, I won't divorce.

259
00:19:46,917 --> 00:19:47,926
What?

260
00:19:47,926 --> 00:19:50,772
I'm not going to do it because I don't want to give you money.

261
00:19:50,772 --> 00:19:53,349
If you want to divorce me, lower the price.

262
00:19:53,626 --> 00:19:58,447
When we got married, you treated me cheaply. When we are divorcing, you are still treating me cheaply.

263
00:19:58,447 --> 00:20:00,688
I'm not letting this go.

264
00:20:01,154 --> 00:20:03,497
We shouldn't have married in the beginning.

265
00:20:03,497 --> 00:20:06,127
Because we didn't have trust that is the foundation of marriage.

266
00:20:20,141 --> 00:20:22,181
You took that pill this morning.
Are you taking that again?

267
00:20:22,181 --> 00:20:24,902
I need to take it so I
can calm my anger down.

268
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:30,557
You take vitamins often. You're going to
live until you put your shit on the wall.

269
00:20:30,557 --> 00:20:32,968
I'm going to live healthy while I can.
You can take some too.

270
00:20:32,968 --> 00:20:35,199
No. I don't want to.

271
00:20:35,199 --> 00:20:37,511
I don't want to live longer.

272
00:20:39,251 --> 00:20:41,785
Did something happen to Hae Jin? You
went to check on her a while ago.

273
00:20:41,785 --> 00:20:43,571
I don't even want to talk about it.

274
00:20:43,571 --> 00:20:48,561
Red at morning. Dead at eve. Little goods,
little care.
A son in law is a son of a bitch.

275
00:20:49,844 --> 00:20:54,140
You're so funny, sis'.

276
00:20:54,140 --> 00:20:56,883
I feel bad for him.

277
00:21:00,097 --> 00:21:02,866
What's up? You went out as if you wouldn't come back.

278
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:04,687
We decided to get married.

279
00:21:04,687 --> 00:21:07,388
Now you stay out of this. Jung Hoon
and I are going to take care of it.

280
00:21:07,611 --> 00:21:10,908
If you can do it, then do it.
I'll stay out of it.

281
00:21:14,410 --> 00:21:15,955
Why is mom like that?

282
00:21:15,955 --> 00:21:19,529
You guys got back together because
she apologized to Jung Hoon's mom.

283
00:21:19,529 --> 00:21:21,491
Did she?
I don't believe it.

284
00:21:21,491 --> 00:21:24,738
She loves you guys in her own way.

285
00:21:24,738 --> 00:21:29,054
There are some side effects, but you must not doubt her love for you two.

286
00:21:29,054 --> 00:21:33,968
Why did she apologize? What did I
do wrong? What did we do wrong?

287
00:21:38,278 --> 00:21:39,629
Mom.

288
00:21:39,629 --> 00:21:41,846
- Did your husband come home?
- Yes.

289
00:21:41,846 --> 00:21:43,353
What did he decide to do?

290
00:21:43,353 --> 00:21:45,482
He says he can't divorce me because he doesn't want to give me money.

291
00:21:45,482 --> 00:21:46,861
That bastard!

292
00:21:46,861 --> 00:21:49,877
What a bad bastard!

293
00:21:49,877 --> 00:21:51,518
What did you tell him? What are you going to do?

294
00:21:52,173 --> 00:21:53,858
I don't know.

295
00:21:53,858 --> 00:21:55,499
Did he say he will end it with the woman?

296
00:21:55,499 --> 00:21:59,018
It doesn't matter if he has a woman or not. She won't be the first.

297
00:21:59,018 --> 00:22:03,596
Can you stay in my house tomorrow?
He will leave sooner if you stay here.

298
00:22:03,714 --> 00:22:07,141
Alright, let's settle this.

299
00:22:09,810 --> 00:22:16,289
Do any of you care about one's career when your kid gets married?

300
00:22:17,379 --> 00:22:22,177
Specifications are society's standards and can't be god's standards.

301
00:22:22,177 --> 00:22:24,435
Love is not calculated.

302
00:22:25,127 --> 00:22:29,949
If there are calculations in love, that means the nature of love has been lost.

303
00:22:31,010 --> 00:22:35,796
The one thing that needs to come first in marriage is love.

304
00:22:36,385 --> 00:22:39,818
Everyone, especially those who have children

305
00:22:39,818 --> 00:22:45,981
we shouldn't make a marriage become a display that you can show off to others.

306
00:22:49,254 --> 00:22:50,980
- Go home safely.
- Yes.

307
00:22:51,686 --> 00:22:53,027
You worked hard.

308
00:22:53,027 --> 00:22:56,421
Stella sister and Peter brother.

309
00:22:56,421 --> 00:22:59,166
It has been long time since you all came to evening mass.

310
00:22:59,166 --> 00:23:02,726
I know. Peter is getting married soon.

311
00:23:02,726 --> 00:23:03,643
Congratulations.

312
00:23:03,643 --> 00:23:06,566
Your service tonight was so good.

313
00:23:06,566 --> 00:23:10,038
The sermon was just right for us.

314
00:23:10,038 --> 00:23:11,263
Where are you having the marriage?

315
00:23:11,263 --> 00:23:14,109
I wish I can do it in church.

316
00:23:14,871 --> 00:23:17,286
Her parents-in-law want to have the wedding in a hotel.

317
00:23:17,286 --> 00:23:21,139
I don't want to do it. But if they want it, I guess I have to follow them.

318
00:23:21,139 --> 00:23:24,633
That's good!
Hae Yoon is so lucky.

319
00:23:24,633 --> 00:23:26,590
I'm so jealous.

320
00:23:26,590 --> 00:23:29,161
Your first son-in-law is the most successful plastic surgeon in Gang Nam.

321
00:23:29,161 --> 00:23:31,269
And your second son in law is from a rich family.

322
00:23:31,269 --> 00:23:33,442
It's not good for me.
It's good for them.

323
00:23:33,442 --> 00:23:36,631
After Hae Yoon gets married,
shut down the store and stay home.

324
00:23:36,631 --> 00:23:38,635
You can ask for your living expenses from your kids.

325
00:23:38,635 --> 00:23:43,773
What are you talking about? I don't want to
be a burden to them. I can live by myself.

326
00:23:45,429 --> 00:23:47,647
- Hey, Hae Yoon.
- Hi.

327
00:23:47,647 --> 00:23:51,142
We were talking about you. I heard you are getting married at a five star hotel.

328
00:23:51,142 --> 00:23:55,064
Even though you look pretty now, you must look more pretty when you get married in a hotel.

329
00:23:55,064 --> 00:23:57,764
- Aren't you going to go business?
- I am going to.

330
00:23:57,764 --> 00:24:00,524
I'm going to take this.
I'll pay you later.

331
00:24:01,435 --> 00:24:03,279
Don't buy food and eat this.

332
00:24:03,279 --> 00:24:05,463
- Where are you going?
- I'm meeting my mother in law.

333
00:24:05,921 --> 00:24:08,386
Now you're becoming her family.

334
00:24:08,386 --> 00:24:09,580
I'm sorry.

335
00:24:09,580 --> 00:24:11,645
Don't be discouraged or lose focus because of what happened.

336
00:24:11,645 --> 00:24:15,168
I decided to apologize to her because
I know how much you love him.

337
00:24:15,168 --> 00:24:17,546
Who is going to become discouraged?

338
00:24:20,742 --> 00:24:22,207
What is this?

339
00:24:22,207 --> 00:24:25,584
It's a gift for you. I was going to give it
to you at the meeting but I forgot about it.

340
00:24:25,584 --> 00:24:28,230
You didn't have to do this.

341
00:24:28,976 --> 00:24:30,629
It's so pretty!

342
00:24:30,629 --> 00:24:33,285
It's a couple of t-shirts made out of eco-friendly material.

343
00:24:33,285 --> 00:24:35,236
It'd be good if I wear this when I go on a trip.

344
00:24:35,236 --> 00:24:37,110
You can wear this at home too.

345
00:24:37,110 --> 00:24:38,964
Thank you, Hye Yoon. I like it.

346
00:24:39,521 --> 00:24:41,917
I want to live like you and father in law.

347
00:24:41,917 --> 00:24:43,263
You will be able to.

348
00:24:43,263 --> 00:24:45,169
They say that after the rain, the earth hardens.

349
00:24:45,169 --> 00:24:48,324
I think that you two's love for each other became harder after what happened.

350
00:24:48,324 --> 00:24:49,448
Yes, mother.

351
00:24:49,448 --> 00:24:51,804
Since the wedding is in
January, we have to hurry up.

352
00:24:51,804 --> 00:24:54,094
I wanted to have it at the Catholic Church. That's okay with you, right?

353
00:24:55,037 --> 00:24:57,421
Didn't you say last time that we should have it at the hotel?

354
00:24:57,421 --> 00:25:00,546
I changed my mind. Having it in the hotel is too common.

355
00:25:00,546 --> 00:25:04,720
I thought it would hold more meaning to have it in the Catholic Church that Jung Hoon grew up in.

356
00:25:04,720 --> 00:25:09,295
When is your mom free? I'm afraid to call her because she might be busy.

357
00:25:09,295 --> 00:25:11,730
It's alright. You can call her anytime.

358
00:25:13,994 --> 00:25:16,250
The two of them suit well together.

359
00:25:16,250 --> 00:25:18,111
Do you know that woman?

360
00:25:18,111 --> 00:25:20,206
I saw her for the first time today.

361
00:25:20,206 --> 00:25:21,615
Then how do you know her?

362
00:25:21,615 --> 00:25:23,949
Ki Joong is marrying two weeks before you guys.

363
00:25:23,949 --> 00:25:26,827
So she must be his fiance.

364
00:25:29,378 --> 00:25:32,017
Aunt, you came? Hye Yoon, you are here too.

365
00:25:32,853 --> 00:25:35,002
This is Han Chae Young.

366
00:25:35,002 --> 00:25:36,324
Hello.

367
00:25:36,324 --> 00:25:38,919
I thought I'm going to see you at dinner next week.

368
00:25:38,919 --> 00:25:41,507
I think in my family, I am the first to see you.

369
00:25:41,507 --> 00:25:44,168
- You are right, aunt.
- This is my future daughter in law.

370
00:25:46,340 --> 00:25:49,643
Your bracelet looks pretty. It would look pretty on you too.

371
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:52,280
If you want it, I'll tell them to have one for you.

372
00:25:52,280 --> 00:25:53,245
It's alright.

373
00:25:53,245 --> 00:25:56,788
Not the same one. It's a little weird when you two aren't even sisters.

374
00:25:56,788 --> 00:26:00,202
There isn't anything more pretty than this in this brand.

375
00:26:00,202 --> 00:26:04,926
What is pretty is subjective. You can't rank beauty.

376
00:26:05,390 --> 00:26:07,668
My aunt is that romantic.

377
00:26:07,668 --> 00:26:11,598
I think it won't fit with Hye Yoon. Aren't you practical person?

378
00:26:11,598 --> 00:26:14,759
It's because you don't know me well. I am romantic too.

379
00:26:14,759 --> 00:26:17,185
Yes, you are saying that because you don't know Hye Yoon well.

380
00:26:17,185 --> 00:26:21,345
Look at this. She bought me a couple t-shirts.

381
00:26:21,345 --> 00:26:22,308
It's pretty, right?

382
00:26:22,308 --> 00:26:26,010
I can't argue about that. It'd look good on you.

383
00:26:26,010 --> 00:26:28,918
You think so too, right? It's also made of eco-friendly material.

384
00:26:28,918 --> 00:26:32,834
You look so excited. You always wanted to
have a daughter. Your dream came true.

385
00:26:32,834 --> 00:26:38,624
Yeah. We're going to write a new history
of mother-in-law and daughter-in-law.

386
00:26:53,402 --> 00:26:56,519
I thought you're not going to spend
any money on Hae Yoon's wedding.

387
00:26:56,519 --> 00:26:59,597
She's having a wedding at a hotel.
I should at least spend money on something.

388
00:26:59,597 --> 00:27:01,407
I can't just sit there and do nothing.

389
00:27:01,407 --> 00:27:03,666
You can't borrow money from the bank?

390
00:27:03,666 --> 00:27:06,744
They said I can't do it anymore. By the
way, why don't you have any money?

391
00:27:06,744 --> 00:27:08,138
Didn't you save some money?

392
00:27:08,138 --> 00:27:11,723
- I did.
- Then let me borrow it. I'll pay you back.

393
00:27:11,723 --> 00:27:13,587
It'd be better to use your money.
I don't want to pay for the interest.

394
00:27:13,587 --> 00:27:15,927
But I lent it to somebody.

395
00:27:15,927 --> 00:27:20,546
No way. Why did you do that?
You shouldn't have done it.

396
00:27:20,546 --> 00:27:23,071
I had to do it.
She needed money urgently.

397
00:27:23,071 --> 00:27:24,995
- Is she going to pay you back?
- Of course.

398
00:27:24,995 --> 00:27:27,820
Should I borrow 20,000,000 won?

399
00:27:27,820 --> 00:27:29,495
Just borrow 10,000,000 won for now.

400
00:27:29,495 --> 00:27:31,134
Yeah. You're doing the right thing.

401
00:27:31,134 --> 00:27:33,694
Hae Jin didn't have a proper wedding.

402
00:27:33,694 --> 00:27:36,290
Hae Yoon is the first one who can have a good wedding in our family.

403
00:27:36,290 --> 00:27:38,388
Don't ever say that in front of Hae Jin.

404
00:27:38,388 --> 00:27:40,605
Why not?
She's happy now.

405
00:27:40,605 --> 00:27:43,309
Ki Joong's fiance is the youngest daughter of Jae Il group's CEO.

406
00:27:43,309 --> 00:27:45,725
I think she's kind of spoiled.

407
00:27:45,832 --> 00:27:47,181
Why do you think that?

408
00:27:47,181 --> 00:27:52,877
Just like she's in the center of this world,
she thinks what she wears is the prettiest.

409
00:27:54,153 --> 00:27:58,756
I don't usually gossip about other people.
I'm telling you this because it's you.

410
00:27:58,756 --> 00:28:00,781
I know, mother.

411
00:28:00,781 --> 00:28:02,770
It's there.

412
00:28:05,927 --> 00:28:08,079
- How does this look?
- It's okay.

413
00:28:08,079 --> 00:28:09,715
I don't like that answer.

414
00:28:09,715 --> 00:28:13,195
You should like it very much.

415
00:28:13,195 --> 00:28:14,895
Yes.

416
00:28:15,665 --> 00:28:17,259
Then what about this?

417
00:28:17,930 --> 00:28:20,983
I'm really going to go crazy. What should I say to please her?

418
00:28:20,983 --> 00:28:23,894
Mother, you choose it for me. Your style is classy and I like it.

419
00:28:23,894 --> 00:28:26,400
Really? Alright, I'll choose it for you.

420
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:30,455
- Please show us this.
- Alright, madam.

421
00:28:37,052 --> 00:28:38,765
I rode the taxi with Hye Yoon.

422
00:28:38,765 --> 00:28:40,513
Hye Yoon, let's take a picture.

423
00:28:40,513 --> 00:28:42,550
Look here.

424
00:28:42,550 --> 00:28:44,537
One, two...

425
00:28:46,235 --> 00:28:48,309
Let's take another picture with your bracelet in it.

426
00:28:48,309 --> 00:28:50,338
- Yes.
- So it shows well.

427
00:28:50,338 --> 00:28:54,004
Hye Yoon, look here.

428
00:29:02,110 --> 00:29:04,318
They're looking good.

429
00:29:10,669 --> 00:29:13,023
Shoot.

430
00:29:13,023 --> 00:29:15,709
But I should save my fiance's face.

431
00:29:27,899 --> 00:29:30,178
Don't make that look.

432
00:29:30,178 --> 00:29:32,485
- I don't like that.
- We're over.

433
00:29:32,485 --> 00:29:36,043
You can't just cut off our relationship
like you cut off a fruit or something.

434
00:29:36,043 --> 00:29:38,139
You should know because you're old enough.

435
00:29:38,139 --> 00:29:39,975
This will only hurt you.

436
00:29:39,975 --> 00:29:46,448
I am not marrying you. I won't touch your wife. In that case, we can still meet, right?

437
00:29:48,296 --> 00:29:50,603
Even if we break up, I'm not going to keep the studio.

438
00:29:50,603 --> 00:29:53,945
If I wanted your money, I wouldn't have come here.

439
00:30:00,754 --> 00:30:03,175
- Please wait a moment.
- Alright, I understand.

440
00:30:15,365 --> 00:30:16,956
Even a woman like her has plastic surgery.

441
00:30:16,956 --> 00:30:19,121
I think she does everything.

442
00:30:25,764 --> 00:30:27,783
Hey, have a seat here.

443
00:30:31,458 --> 00:30:33,039
What's up?

444
00:30:33,039 --> 00:30:36,376
This is the money you paid for the meal at the meeting.

445
00:30:36,376 --> 00:30:39,152
Why would you bring me this? I paid because I felt bad for being late.

446
00:30:39,152 --> 00:30:41,795
You can buy me dinner or something later.

447
00:30:41,795 --> 00:30:46,128
A man doesn't have to pay for this. A woman
can pay for this too. Or they do dutch.

448
00:30:46,128 --> 00:30:47,870
It doesn't really matter.

449
00:30:47,870 --> 00:30:50,848
I wanted to make points from Hae Yoon's mother but I missed it.

450
00:30:51,289 --> 00:30:53,075
Mother in law?

451
00:30:53,075 --> 00:30:54,395
It's a good time.

452
00:30:54,395 --> 00:30:57,995
Since we are a family, let's become closer. Invite me to your house as well.

453
00:30:58,404 --> 00:30:59,404
Alright.

454
00:30:59,404 --> 00:31:01,953
I'll go now. The lunch period for my company is going to end.

455
00:31:02,779 --> 00:31:05,297
Think carefully about marriage.

456
00:31:05,364 --> 00:31:08,662
I'm saying you still have a chance to run away before you walk into the the wedding hall.

457
00:31:08,827 --> 00:31:11,274
I want to go into the wedding hall quickly.

458
00:31:11,274 --> 00:31:13,854
Since it has been decided, I want to get it over with.

459
00:31:18,744 --> 00:31:21,645
Maybe you need some rest. Do you want to go home?

460
00:31:21,645 --> 00:31:22,987
No, mother.

461
00:31:23,222 --> 00:31:26,950
You shouldn't feel tired at your age just because of this.

462
00:31:26,950 --> 00:31:28,093
Yes.

463
00:31:28,093 --> 00:31:30,142
I told you to come because I had something to tell you.

464
00:31:30,142 --> 00:31:33,278
To be married in a Catholic Church, you have to be qualified.

465
00:31:33,648 --> 00:31:35,452
What qualification?

466
00:31:35,452 --> 00:31:41,179
You need to learn some stuff about church and you also need to go see the priest.

467
00:31:41,179 --> 00:31:47,317
At this opportunity, I would like to tell you to decide on a religion, but since religion is your choice, you decide.

468
00:31:47,317 --> 00:31:49,012
It's from smoke into smother...

469
00:31:55,319 --> 00:31:56,485
Are you going on a trip?

470
00:31:56,485 --> 00:31:58,022
No, I'm going to Hae Jin's house.

471
00:31:58,022 --> 00:31:59,910
How long are you going to stay?

472
00:31:59,910 --> 00:32:02,035
This should bring at least those to sleep over at her house.

473
00:32:02,691 --> 00:32:03,691
What is that?

474
00:32:03,691 --> 00:32:05,204
Mother bought it for me.

475
00:32:05,204 --> 00:32:08,520
She should give you something bigger instead of spending money on unnecessary things.

476
00:32:08,708 --> 00:32:11,599
- How much is it?
- If you hear it, you will faint.

477
00:32:11,599 --> 00:32:13,213
Let's hear it so I can faint. How much is it?

478
00:32:13,213 --> 00:32:14,858
3,000,000 won.

479
00:32:15,558 --> 00:32:18,403
She must be crazy. I had to loan money because I don't have enough money for the wedding.

480
00:32:18,403 --> 00:32:19,532
Did you really do that?

481
00:32:19,532 --> 00:32:22,085
She wants to have your wedding at the hotel. I should at least do that.

482
00:32:22,085 --> 00:32:24,454
She says she wants to have it in a Catholic Church instead of a hotel.

483
00:32:24,547 --> 00:32:27,280
What nonsense is that?

484
00:32:27,280 --> 00:32:30,401
She was the one who wanted to have the wedding at the hotel!

485
00:32:30,401 --> 00:32:31,859
You didn't like that idea though.

486
00:32:31,859 --> 00:32:33,481
Because it costs so much.

487
00:32:33,481 --> 00:32:36,647
Come to think of it, I think they're going pay
for the place since they want to do it there.

488
00:32:36,647 --> 00:32:38,061
It wasn't something I should object.

489
00:32:38,061 --> 00:32:40,773
You only get married once in your life time. It looks good when others see it.

490
00:32:40,773 --> 00:32:42,124
So what did you say to her?

491
00:32:42,124 --> 00:32:43,673
I stayed silent.

492
00:32:43,673 --> 00:32:45,144
What did Jung Hoon say?

493
00:32:45,144 --> 00:32:48,454
I didn't hear anything from Jung Hoon. He probably will follow his mother's words.

494
00:32:48,454 --> 00:32:53,052
Hey! What are you going to after getting married if you can't even control your man?

495
00:32:53,052 --> 00:32:54,803
If you're going to live like this, call off the engagement!

496
00:32:54,803 --> 00:32:56,007
Mom!

497
00:32:56,007 --> 00:32:58,405
I don't want you to feel small. You know how Hae Jin lives with Do Hyun.

498
00:32:58,405 --> 00:33:01,411
Think straight! Once you get controlled by him, then you're going to keep losing.

499
00:33:13,502 --> 00:33:16,054
- Why did you call me here?
- You surprised me.

500
00:33:16,200 --> 00:33:18,718
If somebody saw, they would think we are getting married here.

501
00:33:18,718 --> 00:33:20,499
We can tell them we are getting married here.

502
00:33:21,032 --> 00:33:24,346
It really feels like we are getting married once you step up here.

503
00:33:24,566 --> 00:33:28,465
Do you remember when I said if I could do whatever I wanted and you said I could?

504
00:33:28,465 --> 00:33:29,503
Yes.

505
00:33:29,503 --> 00:33:31,961
But I can't really do what I want.

506
00:33:31,961 --> 00:33:35,427
And the wedding hall too. Why didn't you tell me the location was changed to the Catholic Church?

507
00:33:35,427 --> 00:33:38,109
It hasn't been decided yet. We have to hear your mother's opinion too.

508
00:33:38,109 --> 00:33:40,585
If mother wants to have it there, we have to do that.

509
00:33:40,585 --> 00:33:43,331
- Does what my mom says have an effect?
- Of course.

510
00:33:43,331 --> 00:33:46,075
If I think about how you dumped me because of your mom, I get so upset.

511
00:33:46,075 --> 00:33:47,657
Since that, my opinion is ignored.

512
00:33:47,657 --> 00:33:49,491
You said we won't speak of that again.

513
00:33:49,491 --> 00:33:50,873
It became a trauma.

514
00:33:50,873 --> 00:33:53,243
I think from now on whenever anything happens, I will mention it again.

515
00:33:53,243 --> 00:33:55,590
You said you would trust me and follow me. This is not trusting me.

516
00:33:55,590 --> 00:33:59,818
I keep being like this unconsciously. You need to show me more affection than last time for it to end.

517
00:33:59,818 --> 00:34:02,116
I'll be the first and the last person who has the wedding in my family.

518
00:34:02,116 --> 00:34:04,396
My mom wants it to be the most meaningful.

519
00:34:04,396 --> 00:34:08,293
I grew up there and it affected my life.

520
00:34:08,293 --> 00:34:11,022
It might be a place full of memories for you, but it's a strange place for me.

521
00:34:11,022 --> 00:34:15,520
Also, I heard that you have to get an education to get married there. That is too much for me.

522
00:34:15,520 --> 00:34:16,543
Then what do you want to do?

523
00:34:16,543 --> 00:34:19,308
It's not that I don't want to get married at the Catholic Church, but I want to do it here.

524
00:34:19,308 --> 00:34:21,399
I also have romance for my wedding.

525
00:34:21,399 --> 00:34:23,836
I want to shine that day.

526
00:34:23,836 --> 00:34:25,997
Alright, I'll take care of it.

527
00:34:25,997 --> 00:34:29,080
You're going to listen to your mom anyway!

528
00:34:30,348 --> 00:34:31,666
Hye Yoon.

529
00:34:31,666 --> 00:34:33,773
Don't look! Don't look until I get up.

530
00:34:34,519 --> 00:34:36,742
Alright, I turned around.

531
00:34:36,742 --> 00:34:39,084
I turned around.

532
00:34:39,084 --> 00:34:42,986
Did you get up yet? I'm turning around.

533
00:34:43,481 --> 00:34:45,691
I'm turning.

534
00:34:54,917 --> 00:34:56,559
Ahjussi, please go.

535
00:34:57,064 --> 00:34:59,217
Hye Yoon!

536
00:35:05,324 --> 00:35:09,488
You know how there is depression for when you are living? Is there one for marriage as well?

537
00:35:10,083 --> 00:35:13,823
I don't know why we can't negotiate at least one thing.

538
00:35:13,823 --> 00:35:17,609
Why does 'I'll take care of it' sound so empty?

539
00:35:18,030 --> 00:35:22,612
Why is where you get married important? It's the person you are getting married to that is important.

540
00:35:22,612 --> 00:35:26,531
You will know if you start preparing for the wedding.

541
00:35:26,531 --> 00:35:30,542
I can't believe it. I was trying to polish the apple for Jung Hoon's mom all day.

542
00:35:30,542 --> 00:35:33,922
But you got a expensive bracelet. You got a brand name bag last time too.

543
00:35:33,922 --> 00:35:35,716
I'd polish the apple 100 times if I can get those.

544
00:35:35,716 --> 00:35:39,468
Think about living like that forever. Is that really good?

545
00:35:46,312 --> 00:35:49,832
What are you doing? Others might think you have a fetish.

546
00:35:49,832 --> 00:35:51,276
What's that?

547
00:35:51,276 --> 00:35:53,597
I know you know what it means. You don't have to act innocent.

548
00:35:54,315 --> 00:35:56,467
Oh my gosh.

549
00:35:56,467 --> 00:36:00,443
If it isn't because of this, I wouldn't have to meet a person like you.

550
00:36:00,640 --> 00:36:04,241
- Let's go, bro.
- Do you also not know what an orgasm is?

551
00:36:04,241 --> 00:36:06,159
Do you want to die?

552
00:36:53,146 --> 00:36:54,716
Who is the new comer?

553
00:36:54,716 --> 00:36:57,159
Who is it that we have to come here?

554
00:37:00,728 --> 00:37:02,266
Aunt?

555
00:37:02,266 --> 00:37:03,910
Long time no see, Do Hyun.

556
00:37:18,318 --> 00:37:21,005
We can drink a beer.

557
00:37:21,005 --> 00:37:23,121
No. You shouldn't drive after you drink.

558
00:37:23,121 --> 00:37:25,029
She follows rules very well.

559
00:37:26,888 --> 00:37:28,568
You aren't going to come continuously, right?

560
00:37:29,009 --> 00:37:32,412
How could you ask him why he brought me here in front of me?

561
00:37:32,658 --> 00:37:36,847
I came here because he told me I should go with him. He told me he would introduce me to good men.

562
00:37:38,209 --> 00:37:41,663
I want you to like me.

563
00:37:41,663 --> 00:37:44,641
Even if you are my hyung, I can't see you acting like that.

564
00:37:45,144 --> 00:37:48,148
You thought well. Go home early.

565
00:37:48,148 --> 00:37:50,492
My sister said that she would sleep at your house as well.

566
00:37:50,789 --> 00:37:52,722
Mother in law is sleeping in my house?

567
00:37:52,722 --> 00:37:55,707
She says she will sleep there because Hye Jin is not in a good condition.

568
00:38:04,710 --> 00:38:05,915
Hello.

569
00:38:05,915 --> 00:38:08,758
This is Jung Hoon's mother. Can we talk on the phone?

570
00:38:08,758 --> 00:38:10,962
If you are running your store...

571
00:38:10,962 --> 00:38:14,636
It's alright. What could be more important than business concerning my child.

572
00:38:14,636 --> 00:38:18,737
Do you have some time tomorrow? I think we need to talk about our children's marriage.

573
00:38:18,737 --> 00:38:21,614
How about you come to Gang Buk this time?

574
00:38:21,614 --> 00:38:25,529
As you know, I am a working person so it is not easy to find time in the morning.

575
00:38:25,529 --> 00:38:28,664
I understand. I will go there.

576
00:38:28,918 --> 00:38:32,864
Yes. Yes.

577
00:38:33,310 --> 00:38:37,483
How could she phrase it like that? Is it easy for me to find time in the morning?

578
00:38:39,533 --> 00:38:41,746
Hey, you're back.
Did you eat?

579
00:38:41,746 --> 00:38:44,897
Mom, can't we just have the marriage at the hotel?

580
00:38:45,629 --> 00:38:46,916
Did Hye Yoon say something?

581
00:38:46,916 --> 00:38:49,266
No. Actually, Hae Yoon doesn't have much free time.

582
00:38:49,266 --> 00:38:52,267
And it's hard for her to do it at church. We only thought about ourselves.

583
00:38:52,267 --> 00:38:55,298
Hye Yoon is very weird. She should have said something a while ago.

584
00:38:55,298 --> 00:38:56,926
I told you that Hye Yoon didn't say anything.

585
00:38:56,926 --> 00:39:00,323
Idiot! Since you are being like this, it makes it seem more likely that Hye Yoon said something.

586
00:39:00,323 --> 00:39:02,934
If you wanted to take her side, you should've done it better.

587
00:39:05,882 --> 00:39:10,359
These two women are making me crazy.
Shoot.

588
00:39:13,036 --> 00:39:14,824
Give me a glass too.

589
00:39:21,029 --> 00:39:23,924
I'm trying to get along with Hae Yoon but if he acts like that, I really don't want to try.

590
00:39:23,924 --> 00:39:25,369
Did he say something?

591
00:39:25,369 --> 00:39:29,592
He is jumpy. It looks like Hye Yoon said something to him about the wedding hall.

592
00:39:29,592 --> 00:39:32,932
It is your assumption that Hye Yoon said something.

593
00:39:32,932 --> 00:39:37,596
My assumption is right. If it is not, he wouldn't be acting like this when he was alright with it yesterday.

594
00:39:38,399 --> 00:39:41,746
If that's what they want, then let them do it at a hotel.

595
00:39:41,746 --> 00:39:44,969
We told the priest that we want to have the wedding at the church.

596
00:39:44,969 --> 00:39:47,476
You said that unpredictably.

597
00:39:47,476 --> 00:39:50,872
I looked into and there are no spaces at the hotel and they have been fully booked.

598
00:39:50,872 --> 00:39:54,252
Also, because of the fact that January 5th is a lucky day, there are no spaces left.

599
00:39:54,252 --> 00:39:57,046
So I thought they were meant to have their wedding at church.

600
00:39:57,768 --> 00:39:59,883
Then we can't do anything.

601
00:39:59,883 --> 00:40:04,189
Yes. I told the Catholic Church executive office that Jung Hoon is getting married on that day.

602
00:40:04,189 --> 00:40:05,791
We can't cancel it.

603
00:40:05,791 --> 00:40:06,659
Already?

604
00:40:06,659 --> 00:40:09,570
I'm the person to execute the plan after deciding.

605
00:40:10,164 --> 00:40:11,522
Then what should we do?

606
00:40:11,522 --> 00:40:14,261
I need to meet with Hye Yoon's mother and talk with her.

607
00:40:14,261 --> 00:40:17,851
She didn't like to have the wedding at a hotel so she will agree with me.

608
00:40:26,716 --> 00:40:30,596
- You came quickly.
- I came quickly because my child needs me.

609
00:40:30,596 --> 00:40:34,105
I'm sorry for making you worry when you must be busy with Hye Yoon's wedding.

610
00:40:34,105 --> 00:40:37,431
Don't think of it as making me worry. It's good that you aren't suffering by yourself and looking for me.

611
00:40:37,723 --> 00:40:39,397
Let's have something delicious to eat.

612
00:40:40,232 --> 00:40:43,166
Let's just order it. I know you're not in a mood for that.

613
00:40:43,166 --> 00:40:45,842
This is why that bastard thinks you are easy to deal with.

614
00:40:48,996 --> 00:40:50,661
I knew you would come.

615
00:41:06,215 --> 00:41:08,389
Why is mother in law at home? I'll go in when she leaves.

616
00:41:12,922 --> 00:41:16,495
Just like you told me, I need a man to make a move.

617
00:41:17,808 --> 00:41:19,531
Where's a blanket?

618
00:41:19,531 --> 00:41:20,569
Sleep in here.

619
00:41:20,569 --> 00:41:22,163
What will you do when your husband comes home?

620
00:41:22,163 --> 00:41:23,546
He isn't coming home. So, let's sleep in here together.

621
00:41:23,546 --> 00:41:25,737
- Why isn't he coming home?
- He found out you came.

622
00:41:25,737 --> 00:41:26,981
He is avoiding me?

623
00:41:26,981 --> 00:41:31,920
Don't bother him at his hospital. It doesn't do any good when we divorce.

624
00:41:31,920 --> 00:41:34,808
- Where did he say he will sleep?
- He will probably sleep in the hospital.

625
00:41:34,808 --> 00:41:37,173
Is it certain? He is with that woman, right?

626
00:41:37,173 --> 00:41:39,016
That woman is not what is important.

627
00:41:39,016 --> 00:41:41,600
Why isn't she important when she is the mail culprit of destroying the family?

628
00:41:41,600 --> 00:41:43,374
You can also ask her for compensation.

629
00:41:43,374 --> 00:41:45,116
I don't want to do that.

630
00:41:45,116 --> 00:41:47,778
- You still have some left.
- What?

631
00:41:47,778 --> 00:41:49,584
You still have some feelings left for your husband.

632
00:41:49,584 --> 00:41:51,923
- You can't divorce with those feelings.
- It's not that.

633
00:41:52,348 --> 00:41:56,275
Even if you get a divorce, there will be men like him around you.

634
00:41:56,275 --> 00:41:58,212
In addition, you have a child.

635
00:41:59,247 --> 00:42:02,180
Think about it well. You can break it off anytime.

636
00:42:02,180 --> 00:42:05,738
But you have to break it off when you want to. Don't do it because your husband tells you to.

637
00:42:06,216 --> 00:42:08,814
From what I can see, you aren't certain yet.

638
00:42:08,814 --> 00:42:11,924
You have to be more careful about divorce than marriage.

639
00:42:11,924 --> 00:42:14,115
Do you think it's easy for a single woman to live while raising a child?

640
00:42:14,115 --> 00:42:16,106
Look at your mother. It is hard.

641
00:42:16,106 --> 00:42:19,150
You weren't happy when dad was alive.

642
00:42:19,150 --> 00:42:21,766
How can you tell just by looking at the outside of a couple's relationship?

643
00:42:21,766 --> 00:42:26,908
We had a deep relationship though. He didn't make a lot of money.

644
00:42:26,908 --> 00:42:28,163
Everything else about him was good.

645
00:42:30,311 --> 00:42:32,777
I think of him a lot when I prepared for your wedding.

646
00:42:32,777 --> 00:42:35,970
Do you know how it feels to prepare a kid's wedding alone?

647
00:43:26,356 --> 00:43:28,661
Thank you for coming all the way over here.

648
00:43:28,661 --> 00:43:31,752
It's not a big deal. We've always met at Gangnam.

649
00:43:31,752 --> 00:43:33,692
Of course I should come here this time.

650
00:43:33,692 --> 00:43:37,094
- You look annoyed.
- Me?

651
00:43:37,094 --> 00:43:37,923
No, I don't.

652
00:43:37,923 --> 00:43:41,781
Didn't you want to have the wedding at church because of family reasons?

653
00:43:42,729 --> 00:43:46,673
No, it's not. Our family is still good.

654
00:43:46,673 --> 00:43:49,857
I'm glad to hear that. I was kind of worried.

655
00:43:58,494 --> 00:44:02,744
The reason why I choose church was that it's very meaningful, not because of money.

656
00:44:03,706 --> 00:44:06,970
I see. Now I don't need to worry.

657
00:44:06,970 --> 00:44:11,355
I guess Hae Yoon doesn't like to have her wedding at church.

658
00:44:11,355 --> 00:44:12,992
It's not that.

659
00:44:12,992 --> 00:44:15,416
I think people around her told her...

660
00:44:15,416 --> 00:44:19,532
a woman like you deserves to have a wedding at a hotel.

661
00:44:20,141 --> 00:44:24,828
If you were a woman, wouldn't you like to have your wedding at a hotel?

662
00:44:24,828 --> 00:44:29,391
I didn't know she is easily influenced by others.

663
00:44:30,226 --> 00:44:34,136
You said you want to do it at the hotel at the meeting.

664
00:44:34,136 --> 00:44:38,796
So we decided to do it at a hotel just like you said.

665
00:44:39,831 --> 00:44:42,012
Really?

666
00:44:42,012 --> 00:44:44,699
I don't know if you know how it feels.

667
00:44:44,699 --> 00:44:49,967
Disappointed when I was prepared to eat
beef but a chef gives me pasta instead.

668
00:44:57,429 --> 00:45:00,039
- Please give me a glass of water.
- Okay.

669
00:45:00,039 --> 00:45:01,964
Did Hae Yoon come here yet?

670
00:45:01,964 --> 00:45:05,607
She didn't because I don't see her.

671
00:45:05,607 --> 00:45:08,622
Why is she not here yet?

672
00:45:20,939 --> 00:45:24,239
Hey, this is a new toy that my company made.

673
00:45:24,239 --> 00:45:27,204
I can put this right next to the other one.

674
00:45:27,204 --> 00:45:30,084
- You met my mom, didn't you?
- Yeah.

675
00:45:30,746 --> 00:45:33,664
Can't your family afford to have a wedding at a hotel?

676
00:45:33,664 --> 00:45:35,276
I don't think so.

677
00:45:35,276 --> 00:45:39,965
I think she's very confused. You need to help her at this kind of situation.

678
00:45:41,447 --> 00:45:43,978
Hae Yoon decided to marry you because she trusts you.

679
00:45:44,457 --> 00:45:45,816
I know.

680
00:45:45,816 --> 00:45:48,762
Did you forget what you did to Hae Yoon
last time? Are you going to do that again?

681
00:45:50,570 --> 00:45:52,457
Why aren't you answering?

682
00:45:52,457 --> 00:45:55,413
No. I will do everything.

683
00:45:55,413 --> 00:45:58,702
Good. A woman's behavior depends on her man.

684
00:45:58,702 --> 00:46:01,958
If you're good to her, she will do better.

685
00:46:07,314 --> 00:46:10,000
- Hi. Take this.
- You didn't have to do this.

686
00:46:10,000 --> 00:46:13,241
Unless it's really delicious, I don't eat cake.
It makes me fat.

687
00:46:13,782 --> 00:46:16,511
- Okay.
- Come here. I need to talk to you.

688
00:46:16,511 --> 00:46:18,186
Sure.

689
00:46:24,083 --> 00:46:26,755
I think I have to say words unpleasant to the ear.

690
00:46:27,125 --> 00:46:30,694
Who I hate the most is a person who's not honest.

691
00:46:31,122 --> 00:46:34,797
I tried to get along with you
but you stabbed me in the back.

692
00:46:34,797 --> 00:46:36,120
It's a misunderstanding.

693
00:46:36,120 --> 00:46:38,411
Why didn't you tell me that you don't
want to have the wedding at church?

694
00:46:38,411 --> 00:46:41,756
If you had told me that, I would've found another way.

695
00:46:41,756 --> 00:46:42,903
It's not that I don't like church.

696
00:46:42,903 --> 00:46:45,740
Don't act nice and innocent in front of me.

697
00:46:45,740 --> 00:46:48,015
It doesn't last long just like this time.

698
00:46:48,015 --> 00:46:50,403
I'm sorry.

699
00:46:52,737 --> 00:46:55,613
- Where's Mom?
- Hae Yoon is here.

700
00:46:57,153 --> 00:47:00,040
Are you getting mad because of what I said?
Can I not say this?

701
00:47:00,040 --> 00:47:01,406
Of course you can.

702
00:47:01,406 --> 00:47:03,479
Do you know what I heard from your mother?

703
00:47:03,479 --> 00:47:07,252
She asked me if I have family reasons.
It means we look poor.

704
00:47:07,252 --> 00:47:10,401
I can endure anything but not this one.

705
00:47:10,401 --> 00:47:12,866
You have the heir of the rich.

706
00:47:12,866 --> 00:47:17,635
Thank you. It's very comforting to me.

707
00:47:17,635 --> 00:47:19,685
You came?

708
00:47:19,685 --> 00:47:22,229
Why are you yelling at her?
What did she do wrong?

709
00:47:22,229 --> 00:47:25,000
I wasn't yelling. I was just telling her what I have to.

710
00:47:25,000 --> 00:47:27,656
If Hae Yoon had told me her opinion,
this wouldn't have happened.

711
00:47:27,656 --> 00:47:29,733
I was humiliated by her mother.

712
00:47:29,733 --> 00:47:32,388
You are the one who changed your mind!

713
00:47:32,388 --> 00:47:34,635
If you didn't change your mind,
none of this would've happened!

714
00:47:35,288 --> 00:47:36,536
Hae Jung Hoon!

715
00:47:36,536 --> 00:47:39,469
She's my girl! I can't see her
getting insulted by anybody!

716
00:47:39,469 --> 00:47:41,968
I was just talking to her!

717
00:47:41,968 --> 00:47:43,830
Ask her if I insulted her!

718
00:47:43,830 --> 00:47:45,529
- Hae Yoon...
- No, you didn't.

719
00:47:45,529 --> 00:47:48,579
You should've told me if you come to my house.
Why are you getting insulted?

720
00:47:49,502 --> 00:47:51,237
What are you doing?

721
00:47:57,108 --> 00:47:59,448
Are you crazy?
What are you doing?

722
00:47:59,448 --> 00:48:01,916
You said it traumatized you.
You told me to show you how much I love you.

723
00:48:01,916 --> 00:48:05,566
So I did. I got you out of there in front of
my mother even if it was very rude!

724
00:48:05,566 --> 00:48:07,213
I did what you wanted me to.
What's wrong now?

725
00:48:07,213 --> 00:48:09,219
Why can't you find
a good time to do that?

726
00:48:09,565 --> 00:48:10,564
Don't do that. It hurts.

727
00:48:10,564 --> 00:48:12,896
Of course it hurts you. You need more.

728
00:48:12,896 --> 00:48:15,444
Why did you tell her like that?

729
00:48:15,444 --> 00:48:16,518
That's what you want.

730
00:48:16,518 --> 00:48:20,433
Do you know how hard I tried to get along with her?

731
00:48:20,433 --> 00:48:22,489
I even became her avatar!

732
00:48:22,489 --> 00:48:25,933
What about me then? I paid 5,000,000 won to Do Hyun to save your face.

733
00:48:25,933 --> 00:48:27,643
And I went to see your mom whenever she wants to see me.

734
00:48:27,643 --> 00:48:30,572
I tried my best but all she said was be good to you.

735
00:48:30,572 --> 00:48:33,829
You have a real lack of courtesy toward adults.

736
00:48:33,829 --> 00:48:34,448
What?

737
00:48:34,448 --> 00:48:36,411
They can say words that you don't want to hear.

738
00:48:36,411 --> 00:48:38,183
You can't even stand that you have to make things worse?

739
00:48:38,183 --> 00:48:39,788
You think we can do this marriage?

740
00:48:41,129 --> 00:48:42,802
We decided not to say controversial words to each other.

741
00:48:42,802 --> 00:48:46,108
Even if we get married, we won't be happy
because we lost favor in her eyes!

742
00:48:46,108 --> 00:48:49,484
- Stop!
- If I don't, are you going to dump me again?

743
00:48:49,484 --> 00:48:50,692
Then do it.

744
00:48:50,692 --> 00:48:55,109
If I had known that my mom apologized to your
mom earlier, I wouldn't have clung to you.

745
00:48:55,109 --> 00:48:57,493
What did my mom do so wrong that
she had to apologize to your mom?

746
00:48:57,493 --> 00:48:59,990
Can't she even show off her daughter?

747
00:48:59,990 --> 00:49:04,167
Talk about the present. If we start talking
about past, it will make things worse.

748
00:49:04,167 --> 00:49:07,770
Fine. For us, past is something
that will make us worse.

749
00:49:07,770 --> 00:49:10,310
How am I supposed to see your mother again?

750
00:49:32,393 --> 00:49:33,404
Dad.

751
00:49:33,404 --> 00:49:37,120
What are you doing there?
You should follow her.

752
00:50:14,352 --> 00:50:15,578
Are you not going home?

753
00:50:15,578 --> 00:50:19,359
There's nobody that welcomes me at home.
I'm just going to do this.

754
00:50:25,100 --> 00:50:28,585
Hey, what are you doing here?
Where's Hae Yoon?

755
00:50:28,585 --> 00:50:31,357
Would you like to drink with me?

756
00:50:32,357 --> 00:50:34,010
I'm in.

757
00:50:40,898 --> 00:50:44,085
You ignored my calls so I had to come here.

758
00:50:44,085 --> 00:50:47,155
But it's too late now.

759
00:50:47,155 --> 00:50:51,075
I don't want an awkward relationship with you.

760
00:50:51,075 --> 00:50:53,979
Why did you ignore my calls? I thought
you were still mad or something.

761
00:50:53,979 --> 00:50:57,609
I thought you'd live a happy life with a
daughter of a famous law firm company.

762
00:50:57,609 --> 00:51:01,028
I thought I could use her for my ambition.

763
00:51:01,028 --> 00:51:03,797
But I was eventually controlled by her.

764
00:51:04,179 --> 00:51:07,752
You are a lawyer. You will meet a great woman.

765
00:51:07,752 --> 00:51:11,340
After I got hurt, I realized that having
a comfortable relationship is the best.

766
00:51:16,353 --> 00:51:18,604
I missed you.

767
00:51:18,604 --> 00:51:22,808
Go home and don't ever make that look.

768
00:51:22,808 --> 00:51:24,039
Don't come find me.

769
00:51:24,039 --> 00:51:26,571
Answer the phone. I don't have to come here then.

770
00:51:26,571 --> 00:51:29,335
- Who is he?
- Mom.

771
00:51:29,335 --> 00:51:31,766
- Hi.
- I haven't seen him before.

772
00:51:32,355 --> 00:51:35,433
- We went to college together. Go now.
- I'm going to go even if you tell me not to.

773
00:51:35,433 --> 00:51:37,922
I will see you later.

774
00:51:39,171 --> 00:51:41,835
- Who is he?
- Where were you?

775
00:51:41,835 --> 00:51:44,723
- I was with Hae Jin.
- You go there often.

776
00:51:44,723 --> 00:51:45,799
Do Hyun would hate it.

777
00:51:45,799 --> 00:51:48,229
I don't care if he does or not.

778
00:51:48,229 --> 00:51:50,930
- What does he do?
- He's a lawyer.

779
00:51:50,930 --> 00:51:52,848
A lawyer? Is he married?

780
00:51:53,339 --> 00:51:55,730
Of course, he is.

781
00:51:56,349 --> 00:51:58,734
What was a married man doing here?

782
00:51:59,747 --> 00:52:02,335
I met Jung Hoon's mom and she
said she will think about it.

783
00:52:02,335 --> 00:52:03,758
I know.

784
00:52:03,758 --> 00:52:04,729
How do you know?

785
00:52:04,729 --> 00:52:07,060
I'm not going to share any information with you.

786
00:52:07,060 --> 00:52:08,324
Why aren't you answering?

787
00:52:08,324 --> 00:52:12,327
A life is lonely. It's something I have to go through.

788
00:52:12,573 --> 00:52:15,110
- You were from her house, weren't you?
- How did you know?

789
00:52:15,110 --> 00:52:17,143
I knew it. What did she say?

790
00:52:17,143 --> 00:52:21,733
It's my fault. When she asked
me about church, I said okay.

791
00:52:21,733 --> 00:52:24,261
She told me if I told her what I really think about it, she would've found another way.

792
00:52:24,261 --> 00:52:27,177
It's not easy to say what you really
think in front of a mother-in-law.

793
00:52:27,177 --> 00:52:30,267
Maybe that's what she did to her mother-in-law.
What did Jung Hoon say?

794
00:52:30,267 --> 00:52:34,056
What Jung Hoon thinks is the most important.
No parents can win their kids.

795
00:52:34,056 --> 00:52:36,560
Mom, please don't call Jung Hoon.

796
00:52:36,560 --> 00:52:39,432
If she calls me to meet her, I
feel awkward and uncomfortable.

797
00:52:39,432 --> 00:52:41,953
He will feel the same.

798
00:52:41,953 --> 00:52:44,372
That's a marriage. He has to get used to it.

799
00:52:44,372 --> 00:52:45,870
So do you.

800
00:52:45,870 --> 00:52:49,421
Be careful.

801
00:52:51,066 --> 00:52:52,789
Put him in.

802
00:52:55,207 --> 00:52:58,255
I thought he didn't drink that much but he's so drunk.

803
00:52:58,255 --> 00:53:00,661
It happens sometimes. I'll see you later.

804
00:53:00,661 --> 00:53:01,889
Okay.

805
00:53:03,195 --> 00:53:04,998
Bye.

806
00:53:12,038 --> 00:53:16,494
I'm alone. No. I have Do Hyun.

807
00:53:22,359 --> 00:53:27,217
I'm so lonely. I'm happy if somebody bothers me.

808
00:53:27,749 --> 00:53:30,855
I wish someone could stay with me.

809
00:53:50,763 --> 00:53:53,737
Mom, I can eat by myself.

810
00:53:53,737 --> 00:53:55,116
Really?

811
00:53:55,116 --> 00:54:01,571
I want to show Dad that I can eat by myself
after he gets back from the business trip.

812
00:54:01,571 --> 00:54:03,722
Okay.

813
00:54:10,598 --> 00:54:11,927
Have you rode a motorcycle with him?

814
00:54:32,274 --> 00:54:35,286
My husband's girlfriend is in the friend list.

815
00:54:36,611 --> 00:54:39,457
What a good world.

816
00:54:50,710 --> 00:54:54,196
Mom, can you come watch my kid now?
